WEBVTT

00:05:28.407 --> 00:05:30.451
I even AI hacked "The New York Times."

00:05:30.493 --> 00:05:32.036
That was a little controversial.

00:05:32.078 --> 00:05:33.954
(Laughter)

00:05:33.996 --> 00:05:35.998
We had a lot of artists
reaching out to us,

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:37.958
asking how we were doing it.

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:41.128
So we created tools to allow them
to augment their work.

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:43.422
And very quickly,
we had a community of artists

00:05:43.464 --> 00:05:45.549
covering the world
with their augmented art.

00:05:45.549 --> 00:05:46.717
It was beautiful.

00:05:46.717 --> 00:05:49.970
I felt like my vision was finally
starting to make some traction.

00:05:50.012 --> 00:05:51.180
But up until now,

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:54.225
all the experiences that I've shared
have been standalone.

00:05:54.266 --> 00:05:56.852
For example, a Love Punk's avatar

00:05:56.852 --> 00:05:58.979
kind of like step out of the video game

00:05:58.979 --> 00:06:01.232
and then suddenly appear
walking down the street